According to the spoliers, wisdom affects your ability to pray to your god.
I don't believe this is true...As far as I can tell it affects nothing of
any real significance (it affects the rate you gain energy points, and 
sometimes the amount of time a you can be paralyzed by something's gaze,
but not much else).

>Dexterity lowers your AC, perhaps speeds you up.
Dexterity doesn't lower your AC per se, but it makes you harder to hit 
(since you're better able to dodge), and improves your chances of hitting
monsters.

>Constitution increases your HP and regeneration speed.
It affects your regeneration speed, and also increases the number of 
hit points you gain when you gain a level.

>Charisma affects the price shopkeepers give you, the chance of peaceful
>monsters becoming aggressive (?), ...
Won't affect peaceful monsters becoming aggressive, but does help you
in shopkeeper prices, and having a successful encounter with an
incubus/succubus.
